# Dates Time

- Store UTC (`timestamptz`); display in the user's time zone via `{{lib/format/date.ts}}`.
- Current time from `{{now()}}` helper (testable), never scattered `new Date()`.
- Format with `Intl.DateTimeFormat` for the user's locale; show the time zone when it matters (bookings, deadlines).

## Never
- Local time in the database
- hand-rolled date maths across DST
